# Production build values. Committed deliberately — everything here is PUBLIC.
#
# The Turnstile sitekey is designed to be embedded in the page (Cloudflare renders it in the
# widget markup, so every visitor can read it). It is bound to the hostnames configured on the
# widget, and the matching SECRET key lives only in the Supabase dashboard. Never add a Supabase
# service-role key, a Turnstile secret, or any other real secret to this file.
#
# Supabase URL/anon key are set as Vercel environment variables instead; real env vars take
# precedence over this file, so the two never conflict.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=0x4AAAAAAEFUk6E7ajd5GRKD
